<center><b>Fiction Database Search</b></center>
<font size=-1>
<form method="POST" action="http://DBASELOC/search.cgi"><input name="arg"><select name="type"><option selected>Name&nbsp;<option>Title&nbsp;<option>Year&nbsp;<option>Series&nbsp;<option>Index</select>
<br><input type="submit" value="Submit Query"><input type="reset" value="Clear Form"></form>
<p>
Perform a database search for an author, title, or series 
substring. The year option displays all entries alphabetically by
category for a given year. The index option displays all fiction 
for a given year, and is sorted by author. Search matches
are caseless, and spaces are honored. 
</font>
