<td VALIGN=TOP WIDTH="50%" NOSAVE><font color="#000000"><font size=+2>The
ISFDB</font><font size=+0> is an effort to catalog works of Science Fiction,
Fantasy, and Horror. It links together various types of bibliographic data:
author bibliographies, publication bibliographies, award listings, magazine
content listings, anthology and collection content listings, yearly fiction
indexes, and forthcoming books.</font></font>

